0"}],"annotations":[{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment0:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment0","raw_text":"《弈林新编》杨官璘编著","text":"《弈林新编》杨官璘编著","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":0,"anchor_node_id":"root","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"1。平车保炮，是后手方的一种应着，属于防守地位，如改走炮2进2，则比较灵活，但还是红方易走。","text":"1。平车保炮，是后手方的一种应着，属于防守地位，如改走炮2进2，则比较灵活，但还是红方易走。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"2。如改走车八进四，则马1进2，黑方也有回击之势；现在，车二平三是比校稳健。","text":"2。如改走车八进四，则马1进2，黑方也有回击之势；现在，车二平三是比校稳健。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"3.如改走马四进五，则马7进5，炮五进四，车4退2，以后经过兑子，战斗力量削弱，容易成和。","text":"3.如改走马四进五，则马7进5，炮五进四，车4退2，以后经过兑子，战斗力量削弱，容易成和。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment34:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment34","raw_text":"4。企图各攻一面，但红方的三路兵可以渡河助战，造成了红方较强，如改走象7进9，防红兵渡河，则较为平稳。","text":"4。企图各攻一面，但红方的三路兵可以渡河助战，造成了红方较强，如改走象7进9，防红兵渡河，则较为平稳。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":34,"anchor_node_id":"0:34","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment46:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment46","raw_text":"5。平车失去要津，容易发生危险，改走炮6平8较稳。","text":"5。平车失去要津，容易发生危险，改走炮6平8较稳。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":46,"anchor_node_id":"0:46","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment59:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment59","raw_text":"红胜。(图二二三)||||末后形势，黑方如车1平3去马，则兵四进一，下一步有车七进三等造成杀局，而黑方的车马偏处一隅，不能发生威力，红方获胜。","text":"红胜。(图二二三)\n\n末后形势，黑方如车1平3去马，则兵四进一，下一步有车七进三等造成杀局，而黑方的车马偏处一隅，不能发生威力，红方获胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":59,"anchor_node_id":"0:59","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_36","raw_text":"以后经过兑子，战斗力量削弱，容易成和。","text":"以后经过兑子，战斗力量削弱，容易成和。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"1:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_18","raw_text":"黑方也有回击之势。","text":"黑方也有回击之势。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"2:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_pver":["091016"],"DhtmlXQ_viewurl":["?owner=u&id=69735&f=&isSave="],"DhtmlXQ_adddate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_editdate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["第五局 顺炮直车对横车"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_length":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["全局"],"DhtmlXQ_gametype":["慢棋"],"DhtmlXQ_open":[""],"DhtmlXQ_class":["象棋谱大全-现代棋书专集"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["弈林新编-杨官璘著"],"DhtmlXQ_group":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":["8.对局评注"],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":["1964年5月5日"],"DhtmlXQ_place":["杭州市"],"DhtmlXQ_timerule":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["蔡福如"],"DhtmlXQ_redeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redtime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["孟立国"],"DhtmlXQ_blackeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blacktime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["红胜"],"DhtmlXQ_endtype":[""],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["杨官璘"],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_refer":["www.dpxq.com"],"DhtmlXQ_other":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_hits":["716"],"DhtmlXQ_price":["1"],"DhtmlXQ_owner":["象棋谱大全"],"DhtmlXQ_oldowner":["象棋谱大全"],"DhtmlXQ_hidden":["0"]},"source_tag_count":51,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":3,"structured_branches":2,"line_statuses":{"legal":3},"source_move_records":65,"legal_move_records":65,"annotations":9,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":9}},"source_processing":{"field_resol